			"notes": "BlockyBeavers release for Minecraft Fabric 1.21.\n\n---\n\nBlockyBeavers is a mod which does one thing: it adds beavers to Minecraft.\n\n---\n\nBeavers spawn in forests, birch forest, old growth birch forests and taigas in groups of 3-5 animals.\n\nYou can breed beavers by feeding them carrots or sticks.\n\n---\n\nWhen killed, beavers drop raw beaver meat and up to two beaver fur. Raw beaver can be cooked, so that it provides 6 hunger points (3 bars).\n\nBeaver fur can be used to craft leather. Future crafting recipes for beaver fur are planned."
